<title>SWITZERLAND: Tsubasa sets 50 mln Sfr private note placement.</title>
<headline>Tsubasa sets 50 mln Sfr private note placement.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Industrial Bank of Japan (Switzerland) (IBJ) and co-lead Asahi Bank (Schweiz) AG.</p>
<p>BORROWER - = TSUBASA SYSTEM CO, LTD</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - = IBJ &amp; ASAHI</p>
<p>GUARANTOR - = INDUSTRIAL BANK OF JAPAN, LTD, TOKYO</p>
<p>AMT   = 50 million CHF   COUPON  =  3.625 PCT MATURITY = 27.NOV.01</p>
<p>TYPE  STR		ISS PRICE =100.87    PAY DATE = 27.NOV.96</p>
<p>DENOMINATION - BEARER NOTES OF 50,000 SFR EACH -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
